I've compromised slightly, by the way; it's actually the keyword
plus the first bit of the "definition"; up to the first : or ;

This just give a bit more detail, for learning.  Examples:

le      the described (non-veridical descriptor)
.i      sentence link (sentence link/continuation)
mi      me (pro-sumti)
cu      selbri separator (elidable marker)
nu      event abstract (abstractor)
do      you (pro-sumti)
la      that named (name descriptor)
se      2nd conversion (2nd conversion)
lo      the really is (veridical descriptor)
lu      quote (start grammatical quotation)

